     {
      "locator": {
       "page": 1
      },
      "text": "We propose QAGS,1 an automatic evaluation\nprotocol that is designed to identify factual in-\nconsistencies in a generated summary.\nQAGS has substantially higher\ncorrelations with these judgments than other\nautomatic evaluation metrics."
